<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Thaidas</para>
  <para style="toc1">THAIDAS shii Phaul re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thaidas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Thd</para>
  <para style="mt1">THAIDAS</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Thaidas ne Gaibran è migi rey srane hanyie yi Phaul rog Hamangkhung-aphuii blia shii bliapho nane blia rek gieng pha bran ro. Phaul è Thaidas shii jigigam zey pha ji ne Khrethe hà rai pha filiao jia hanyie aishii nongphi ai beng shii zey phro, hanyie shii thiisa Charch pha blia shii dumuii rek yi pha thoh marui. Jigi ne miigak uom pha chiang shii zey.</para>
  <para style="ip">Igobi, Thaidas shii nowdin yi ji è Charch pha dumuii phothek shii khi-èrek pha ziig um chid, chiih-è hì ne Khrethanthek shii rai pha awie pha ziigphothek duiine arai rabo ne yao. Din ne, charch shii yoh yoh ibrogthek, Firiang, chiih-è miriang shii chiih-è (hanyie yi miliao bimi shii yua chid) chiih-è filiao bufuii, chiih-è khiaothek, shii yua pha chiang shii khi-èrek ne yua pha ji de Thaidas shii yua. Idohhè shii zeypho Thaidas shii Migipho ro ziig chiang shii yua phi pha ji zey, miigak ne liijiing rai ne chiih-è dung ne rai pha, chiih-è khiwegkho, khnaing rai pha ji, nane Charch shii che rai pha ji thoh muii bo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="TIT 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Charch pha ophisphothek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Charchthek shii yoh yoh ibrog pha blia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="TIT 2:1-15">2:1-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lububo rek pha nane Phriie <char style="ior">(<ref loc="TIT 3:1-11">3:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jongsha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3:12-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro khiao nane Isu Masi ro Guaphasamoy Phaul ro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Gu shii ne gua ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è gua pha bran ro migi shii nong phi ne ithek shii ne gathek ro migi pha Izai shii yua pha ji shii noh yi pha thoh ge, <verse eid="TIT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2"/>Nyie yi idang pha chai luthong ji shii rai ro. Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie ne biidiie asi pha ji ne, gethek shii hì pha chai ne ishak jao pha ibi è sbang rek, <verse eid="TIT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3"/>khriig ishak shii ai è ji shii awai mua shii dong phi. Jine gu shii phijong ro, chiih-è gune gethek ro ragia Hamangkhung-aphuii muyung ji è yao.<verse eid="TIT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Khor 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Thi 4:10</ref></char>
    </note>Gethek ro ò um pha migi shii gu zai dufuii, Thaidas shii gu hì zey.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Aphuii Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Masi Isu gethek ro ragia è na shii ne bushun nane liijiing phi bo.<verse eid="TIT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrethe shii Thaidas ro blia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5"/>Jine nyieliieshii nane zab pha thawun shii Charch pha dukho bow srane ithek thuh de nyie chid pha ji mana shii khriig rek yi pha gune na shii Khrethe hà thoh marui. Gu è yao pha ji nowkhlei bo: <verse eid="TIT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:2-7">1Thi 3:2-7</ref></char></note> Dukhowthek ne ichiig oi pho rek chid; aine yiy jia um bie chid,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yiy um bie chid; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">luang jia yiygey bie chid.</char></note> chiih-è airo aniphiing migiphothek um chid chiih-è aphrai mua rone chiih-è miyao anuii pho rone hanyie de athey mua rabo. <verse eid="TIT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7"/>Charch pha dukho nya rek dang ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro blia pha ilkhi ro, ai ne athey phoh um chid. Ai ne wiangwe pho nane khthiie lijieg pho nane phuiithiig pho nane ichiigsow pho chiih-è bang giichak pho arey mua phro. <verse eid="TIT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8"/>Ai ne bran shii wieho chid chiih-è nyie wie shii miie rek chid. Ai ne awai shii zud ne, giang, gang, nane isiiewie um chid. <verse eid="TIT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9"/>Ai ne nyie mua shii migi rek mua chiih-è nyie muyua shii nuii mua pha ji shii ne chuh è khoh chid. Ji duiine ai ne gai shii izai muyua ji è lububo rek mua chiih-è gidieg pho shii ne ithek ichiig doh mua yichid.<verse eid="TIT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10"/>Chiih-è de bajo um ba, Jewish ro giang è rey pha migipho shii, hanyie ne ithek ro awie pha khani ji è gai shii gidieg nane khinrin rek. <verse eid="TIT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11"/>Ithek mulo rai hì ne gak chid phro, nyieliieshii ithek ne nyie ayua pha ithek muyua ji è chiih-è biwo lumuii pha bang rab ne zab pha haliingphothek shii duhug rek ro. <verse eid="TIT 1:11"/><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12-13"/>Hì ne Khrethan awai ro, awaithek ro chaig jia è, hanyie izai yao shii ai è yao, “Khrethanthek ne idang khlamphothek ro, awie pha ibeymuthung, nane siikhad-ajo pha sugowthek ro.” Ji pha chiang è nane ithek shii chieg giung bo, chiihphado ithek shii de chiih-è migi um ruii phro <verse eid="TIT 1:12-13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14"/>chiih-è Jew phaluiithek ne akhoh sha phro chiih-è hanyie è izai shii snai pha bran è thog pha tharothamang pha muyungthek de akhoh sha phro. <verse eid="TIT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15"/>Hanyie ne awai è awaishii igang lei ne zab awai shii igang ro; jishii hanyie yi zia nane migi arekpho, ithek ro khani nane siuthek ne zab zia ro. <verse eid="TIT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16"/>Ithek ne yao ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii thieg ro, jishii ithek ro blia è ne aishii snai muii. Ithek ne khjaipho nane miyao shii anuiipho ro, ithek ne nyie de wie rek pha a-ò ro.<verse eid="TIT 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mua khriig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1"/>Jishii na ne nyie yi khriig muyua nuii pha ji yua chid phro. <verse eid="TIT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2"/>Wegsua hò-aphuiithek shii phuii athiig yi pha, khani sang rek pha, chiih-è zud pha; ithek ro migi shii khriig rek pha, miie nane zud yi pha yua bo. <verse eid="TIT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3"/>Ji duiine wegsua hò-amuiithek shii de gang chai shii rai pho hò-amuii duiine rek bo ne yua bo. Ithek ne biidiie pho nane phuii pha khiao arek yi rabo. Ithek ne nyie wie ji shii yua yi bo, <verse eid="TIT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4"/>chiih-è miliao hò-amuiithek shii de awaithek geythek nane aniphiing shii miie pha dab yi bo,<verse eid="TIT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5"/>Chiih-è awai shii wie nane igang, chiih-è hanyie yi awai gey shii ilab rek pha wie yiy rey srane, hanyie de Hamangkhung-aphuii è thog pha mua shii awie rone ayao ruii phro.<verse eid="TIT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6"/>Ji duiine filiao hò-aphuiithek de zud rek bone ne yua bo. <verse eid="TIT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7"/>Zab pha manathek shii nawaithek de wie ziig pha miiriig rek bo. Nawai muyua shii izai nane lubu phi ne rek bo. <verse eid="TIT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8"/>Makhak-ariing pha khriig miyaogam shii kho bo, chiih-è gethek chiang shii nyie buii yao pha lumuii oi pha chiang è naro suangpho shii ne biwo hà ruii muii phro.<verse eid="TIT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9"/>Khiaothek ne awaithek ithong shii ilab phi ne zab pha blia shii ithek shii sang yi bo. Ithek ne ithongthek shii iidoh achang rabo <verse eid="TIT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10"/>chiih-è ithek ro agow rabo. Ji phachiang shii, chiih-è ithek è rek pha zab shii gethek ro ragia Hamangkhung-aphuii chiang shii yua pha ji wie ibeng rey yi pha ithek ne idang wie nane isiie rone doh yi bo.<verse eid="TIT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii awairo bushun ne zab pha bran ro giawo pha chiang shii dong phi. <verse eid="TIT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12"/>Ji pha bushun è gethek shii biidiie pha hamangkhung-aphuii hà rai pha ji nane sohjambling pha miiyang ji thoh muii bo ne yao ro, chiih-è ichiih sohjambling shii zud, giang, nane hamangkhung-aphuii è yang pha ji shii rai bo, <verse eid="TIT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13"/>chiih-è biisiie gethek ro boh Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Ragia Isu Masi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gethek ro bajoboh Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Ragia Isu Masi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bajoboh Hamangkhung-aphuii nane gethek ro Ragia Isu Masi.</char></note> dong ruii pha, khirzey Inai gethek luthong pha ji khan ne rai ro. <verse eid="TIT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 130:8">Chng 130:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Mul 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Iphy 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Phth 2:9</ref></char></note>Ai è gethek shii awie pha ji è ragia rek pha chiih-è gethek shii igang bran rab pha chiih-è awai ji pha bran rey yi pha chiih-è wie rek yang yi awaishii gethek chiang phi muii.<verse eid="TIT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15"/>Hìthek pha manathek shii yua bo chiih-è nawairo yoithek shii lububo nane giung shii nawai ro riichaithek è khoh bo. Hanyie magunde na shii luii ariig yi rabo.<verse eid="TIT 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Masipho ro ziig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1"/>Nawai bran shii bohkhophothek shii phi pha chiih-è riichaithek shii nuii pha nowkhlei yi bo, chiih-è zab lumuii shii wie rek pha saro yi bo. <verse eid="TIT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2"/>Hanyie shii de buii ayao yi rabo, jishii liijiing nane zab rog dung ne rai bo, chiih-è zab shii idang ziig mieng è doh yi bo. <verse eid="TIT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3"/>Gethek de luang jia shii ne bi-ìe, anuii pha rek chiih-è khinrindun. Gethek de awie pha chid pha nane zab awie pha ichuathek shii sangmiie ne rai, pha ji shii khiao rek. Gethek de makhak-riing nane siakjo shii sieng ne rai; chiih-è gaithek è gathek shii khiijai chiih-è gethek è de ithek khiijai. <verse eid="TIT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4"/>Jishii gethek ragia pha Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun nane miie ji dong mage shii, <verse eid="TIT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5"/>ai è gethek shii ragia rek phi. Jishii hì ne gethek è nyie wie rek pha ji è asi ro, jishii hanyie è awai Ragung So è sud ne gethek shii iwo giak nane iwo chai phi. Chiih-è awai ro bushun ji è gethek shii ragia rek phi. <verse eid="TIT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek ro ragia Isu Masi ji pha chiang è gethek shii Ragung So leyphrid thoi phi, <verse eid="TIT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7"/>ji-è airo bushun è gethek de Hamangkhung-aphuii rog shii khriig rai mua ne gethek luthong pha idang pha chai shii mua ruii phro. <verse eid="TIT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8"/>Hì ne zai yao.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Gu nathek shii hì pha miyao è wie chuh phi pha yang ro, ji-è hanyiethek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii migi rek pho ne, nyie yi wie blia shii rek pha nyie yi wie nane zab è kho pha ji shii isiie rek mua ro. <verse eid="TIT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9"/>Jishii bi-ìe pha khnaingthek, phiang blangthek ro sasab, guithek, chiih-è Iphey chiang mak rek pha ji de thoh muii bo. Jithek pha ne blia adunmey pha nane ibid oi pha ji ro. <verse eid="TIT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10"/>Hanyiethek che pha rek pho shii nyichiieng phriie bo, chiih-è chiihphado ji è muna rek pha nyie oi sha phro. <verse eid="TIT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11"/>Nathek ne thieg è-rek pha bran ne awiedang ro, chiih-è ithek layog è ne ithek ne asi rone doh yi.<verse eid="TIT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha muyuathek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Blk 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Iphi 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Khol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Thi 4:12</ref></char>
    </note>Gu è Arthemas nane Thychikhus nathek hà thoh shii, Nikhopholis hà gu hà wuii yie pha na ne bajo bidiang bo, nyieliieshii gune hakhangshak shii thiisa hà rai pha phakjong ro. <verse eid="TIT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Blk 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:12">1Khor 16:12</ref></char></note>Nathek ne Ipheypho Zenas nane Apholos isa ro luachiug pha ji ne jao yie pha nawaithek ne bajo bidiang bo, chiih-è ithek nyie chid pha ji shii zab riig bo. <verse eid="TIT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14"/>Gethek bran de nyie wie ji shii ishak phi pha dab chid, ji-è izai chid pha ji phi mua; ithek ne thaluii pha chai asieng chid phro.<verse eid="TIT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15"/>Hanyie yie gurog shii um pho zab è nathek shii salamthek thoh ge ro. Gathek ro salamthek de migi pha gathek ijak shii phi bo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne nathek zab shii um bo.<verse eid="TIT 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3"/>
</usx>
